{
  "mn23:0.1": "Middle Discourses 23 ",
  "mn23:0.2": "The Termite Mound ",
  "mn23:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "mn23:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery. ",
  "mn23:1.3": "Now at that time Venerable Kassapa the Prince was staying in the Dark Forest. ",
  "mn23:1.4": "Then, late at night, a glorious deity, lighting up the entire Dark Forest, went up to Kassapa the Prince, stood to one side, and said: ",
  "mn23:2.1": "“Monk, monk! This termite mound fumes by night and flames by day. ",
  "mn23:2.2": "The brahmin said, ",
  "mn23:2.3": "‘Dig, clever one, having picked up the sword!’ ",
  "mn23:2.4": "Picking up the sword and digging, the clever one saw a sticking point: ",
  "mn23:2.5": "‘A sticking point, sir!’ ",
  "mn23:2.6": "The brahmin said, ",
  "mn23:2.7": "‘Throw out the sticking point! ",
  "mn23:2.8": "Dig, clever one, having picked up the sword!’ ",
  "mn23:2.9": "Picking up the sword and digging, the clever one saw a bullfrog: ",
  "mn23:2.10": "‘A bullfrog, sir!’ ",
  "mn23:2.11": "The brahmin said, ",
  "mn23:2.12": "‘Throw out the bullfrog! ",
  "mn23:2.13": "Dig, clever one, having picked up the sword!’ ",
  "mn23:2.14": "Picking up the sword and digging, the clever one saw a forked path: ",
  "mn23:2.15": "‘A forked path, sir!’ ",
  "mn23:2.16": "The brahmin said, ",
  "mn23:2.17": "‘Throw out the forked path! ",
  "mn23:2.18": "Dig, clever one, having picked up the sword!’ ",
  "mn23:2.19"